<Layout title="Privacy Promise | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Our privacy promise</div><h1>You get the standing rule you agree on.</h1><p class="lead">At 18 the chart is theirs. We write down what to share with you — and we follow it.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num">1</div><h3>Named on day one</h3><p>Hometown physician, city, and phone. We introduce ourselves before anything is wrong.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">2</div><h3>The rule you agree on</h3><p>Your student has a say. You get the standing rule. Copied when it counts: infections, injuries, new meds.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="num">3</div><h3>A letter the same afternoon</h3><p>Their hometown doctor stays in the letter. May note home. August starts from a full page.</p></div></div>
<p class="note">If we believe your student is in danger, we'll act to keep them safe, as the law allows. This site never asks for symptoms, diagnoses, or records.</p></div>
</Layout>
